graph TD
    A[DNA Damage Event] --> B{Lesion Type?}
    
    B -->|UV Damage| C[Cyclobutane Pyrimidine Dimers]
    B -->|UV Damage| D[6-4 Photoproducts]
    B -->|Chemical Adduct| E[Bulky DNA Adducts]
    B -->|Oxidative| F[Other Helix-Distorting Lesions]
    
    C --> G[Major Helix Distortion]
    D --> G
    E --> G
    F --> G
    
    %% Damage Recognition Pathway Choice
    G --> H{Repair Pathway?}
    
    H -->|Transcription-Coupled| I[RNA Pol Stalled at Lesion]
    H -->|Global Genome| J[UvrA-UvrB Complex Formation]
    
    %% Transcription-Coupled NER
    I --> K[Mfd Transcription Repair Coupling Factor]
    K --> L[RNA Pol Displacement]
    L --> M[Mfd Recruitment of UvrA]
    M --> J
    
    %% Global Genome NER - Damage Recognition
    J --> N[UvrA2-UvrB1 Complex]
    N --> O[ATP-Dependent DNA Scanning]
    O --> P{Damage Detected?}
    
    P -->|No Damage| Q[Continue Scanning]
    Q --> O
    P -->|Potential Damage| R[UvrB Loading]
    
    R --> S[UvrB DNA Unwinding]
    S --> T[β-Hairpin Insertion]
    T --> U{Damage Verification?}
    
    U -->|False Positive| V[UvrA-UvrB Dissociation]
    V --> O
    U -->|True Damage| W[Stable UvrB-DNA Complex]
    
    %% UvrA Dissociation and UvrC Recruitment
    W --> X[ATP Hydrolysis]
    X --> Y[UvrA Dissociation]
    Y --> Z[UvrB Remains Bound]
    
    Z --> AA[UvrC Recognition of UvrB]
    AA --> AB{UvrC Recruitment?}
    AB -->|Yes| AC[UvrB-UvrC Complex]
    AB -->|No| AD[Abortive Repair]
    
    %% Dual Incision
    AC --> AE{Incision Coordination?}
    AE -->|Both Sites Ready| AF[Dual Incision]
    
    AF --> AG[UvrC 3' Incision]
    AG --> AH[4-5 nt 3' to Lesion]
    AH --> AI[UvrC 5' Incision]
    AI --> AJ[8 nt 5' to Lesion]
    
    AJ --> AK[12-13 nt Fragment Generated]
    AK --> AL[UvrC Dissociation]
    
    %% Excision and Gap Creation
    AL --> AM[UvrD Helicase Recognition]
    AM --> AN{UvrD Activity?}
    AN -->|ATP Available| AO[Helicase Unwinding]
    AN -->|No ATP| AP[Stalled State]
    
    AO --> AQ[5' to 3' Translocation]
    AQ --> AR[Oligonucleotide Displacement]
    AR --> AS[Excised Fragment Release]
    AS --> AT[UvrB Dissociation]
    
    AT --> AU[Single-Strand Gap 12-13 nt]
    AU --> AV{Gap Filling Ready?}
    
    %% DNA Synthesis
    AV -->|3'-OH Present| AW[DNA Pol I Recognition]
    AV -->|End Processing Needed| AX[Additional Factors]
    
    AW --> AY[Pol I 5'-3' Polymerase]
    AY --> AZ[dNTP Incorporation]
    AZ --> BA[Processive Synthesis]
    BA --> BB[Gap Filled 12-13 nt]
    
    BB --> BC{Nick Remaining?}
    BC -->|Yes| BD[DNA Ligase Recognition]
    BC -->|No| BE[Unexpected State]
    
    %% Nick Sealing
    BD --> BF[NAD+ Ligase LigA]
    BF --> BG[Adenylate Transfer]
    BG --> BH[Phosphodiester Bond Formation]
    BH --> BI[Nick Sealed]
    
    BI --> BJ[Restored DNA Helix]
    BJ --> BK{Repair Verification?}
    BK -->|Successful| BL[Genome Integrity]
    BK -->|Residual Damage| BM[Secondary Repair]
    
    %% Quality Control
    BL --> BN[Normal DNA Structure]
    BN --> BO[Replication Competent]
    BO --> BP[Transcription Competent]
    BP --> BQ[Cell Survival]
    
    %% Error Pathways
    AD --> BR[Incomplete Repair]
    AP --> BR
    BE --> BR
    BM --> BS{Lesion Persistent?}
    BS -->|Yes| BT[Alternative Repair Pathways]
    BS -->|Bypass| BU[Translesion Synthesis]
    
    BT --> BV[Recombination Repair]
    BU --> BW[Error-Prone Bypass]
    
    %% Regulation and Coordination
    AX --> BY{Processing Type?}
    BY -->|3' Block| BZ(\1)
    BY -->|5' Block| CA(\1)
    BZ --> AV
    CA --> AV
    
    %% Final Outcomes
    BQ --> CB[Successful NER]
    BV --> CC[Backup Repair]
    BW --> CD[Mutagenic Outcome]
    

